NVIDIA DLSS Super Resolution through a DLL that implements include/rex/graphics/d3d12/rex_dlss_bridge.h, so the GPU
plugin needs neither the NVIDIA SDK nor the DLL to build or run. DlssBridge loads the DLL (never unloaded: NGX's threads
may still call its log callback), checks the adapter against NVIDIA's feature requirements and initializes NGX on the
device. Nothing loads it before 0161's scene upscaler draws a scene with DLSS selected. d3d12_dlss_ngx_log_level
forwards NGX's own log (0 none, 1 normal, 2 verbose).

